# Deployment
.kamal/secrets
# ansible/vault/secrets.yml is COMMITTED, encrypted, deliberately. It is
# ansible-vault ciphertext, and the app's environment must be reconstructible
# from the repo alone — ignoring it is why production's APP_KEY existed only
# inside a running container until 2026-08-21.
*.pem
